From: =?UTF-8?q?Michael=20Br=C3=BCning?= <michael.bruning@qt.io>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:10:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [fixup][roll][expat] Roll expat to 2.8.5

We need the XML_DEV_URANDOM define in the configuration for the
build to work on macOS.

Change-Id: Ie18596c6b3c69fefd8062edbde9668c32fed2bc6
Reviewed-on: https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtwebengine-chromium/+/784620
Reviewed-by: Michal Klocek <michal.klocek@qt.io>
Reviewed-by: Anu Aliyas <anu.aliyas@qt.io>
---
 chromium/third_party/expat/include/expat_config/expat_config.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/chromium/third_party/expat/include/expat_config/expat_config.h b/chromium/third_party/expat/include/expat_config/expat_config.h
index 802bf5bba26..72e53777a29 100644
--- a/chromium/third_party/expat/include/expat_config/expat_config.h
+++ b/chromium/third_party/expat/include/expat_config/expat_config.h
@@ -124,6 +124,7 @@
 
 /* Define to include code reading entropy from `/dev/urandom'. */
 /* #undef XML_DEV_URANDOM */
+#define XML_DEV_URANDOM 1
 
 /* Define to make parameter entity parsing functionality available. */
 #define XML_DTD 1
